Weather.txtx
lab for TAC368

Write an app that fetches the temperature from weatherapi.com
and displays it.  You will have to make an account, at which
point they will give you a key that you must send them when
you want to use their interface.  

If I give you starter code, then add to it.  My solution 
takes the zip code and then give temperature and wind
speed.  You should be able to look in the help files
to see how to find this information.  

